email_account_exists_body:
Hello,

someone, hopefully you, tried to sign up to Promptbook with this address, but it already has an account.

Sign in with your passkey: {signInLink}

Lost your passkeys? Recover access: {recoveryLink}

If this was not you, you can ignore this email.

email_engine_offline_body:
Hello,

we have not heard from your Promptbook engine since {lastSeenAt} (UTC).

Engine: {hostname}
Engine ID: {engineId}

Check that the machine is running and connected to the internet. Its status is on the engine page:

{link}

We send this once per outage. Your engine's data never passes through the dashboard, so this is all we know.
